**Combined (weighted code:0.3, reasoning:0.2, prose:0.15, json:0.15, file_edit:0.1, summarization:0.1)** — decode t/s median ≈ **273.6**, update p99 ≈ **12.7 ms**, TTFT p50 ≈ **50 ms**

